@startuml Saga Chorégraphiée - Virement Interbancaire
title Saga Chorégraphiée - Virement Interbancaire (Architecture MVP)

actor "Client / Bank A" as Client
participant "API Gateway\n:8080" as Gateway
participant "Payment\nOrchestration\n:8093" as Payment
participant "Kafka\nBroker" as Kafka
participant "Alias\nService\n:8092" as Alias
participant "Bank A\n(Local)" as BankA
participant "Bank B\n(Local)" as BankB
participant "Clearing &\nSettlement\n:8094" as Settlement

== Step 1: Client Initiate ==
Client -> Gateway: POST /api/payment/initiate\n{alias, amount, idempotencyKey}
Gateway -> Payment: Forward request

activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: valider requête\nvérifier idempotencyKey\ncréer Payment(status=INITIATED)
Payment -> Payment: enregistrer OutboxEvent\n(payment.initiated)
Payment --> Gateway: 201 Created\n{paymentId, status}
deactivate Payment

Gateway --> Client: 201 Accepted\npaymentId

== Step 2: Publish Event & Alias Resolution ==
Payment -> Kafka: publish payment.initiated
Kafka -> Alias: listen payment.initiated

activate Alias
Alias -> Alias: résoudre alias\ntrouver participant & account\ncréer OutboxEvent\n(alias.resolved)
Alias -> Kafka: publish alias.resolved
deactivate Alias

== Step 3: Payment Orch Receives Alias ==
Kafka -> Payment: listen alias.resolved

activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: update status = DEBIT_REQUESTED\nenregistrer OutboxEvent\n(payment.debit_requested)
Payment -> Kafka: publish payment.debit_requested
deactivate Payment

== Step 4: Bank A Processes Debit ==
Kafka -> BankA: webhook payment.debit_requested

activate BankA
BankA -> BankA: débiter Alice -100 CAD\nenregistrer OutboxEvent\n(bank_a.debit_accepted)
BankA -> Kafka: publish bank_a.debit_accepted
deactivate BankA

== Step 5: Payment Orch Routes to Bank B ==
Kafka -> Payment: listen bank_a.debit_accepted

activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: update status = CREDIT_REQUESTED\nenregistrer OutboxEvent\n(payment.credit_requested)
Payment -> Kafka: publish payment.credit_requested
deactivate Payment

== Step 6: Bank B Processes Credit ==
Kafka -> BankB: webhook payment.credit_requested

activate BankB
BankB -> BankB: créditer Bob +100 CAD\nenregistrer OutboxEvent\n(bank_b.credit_accepted)
BankB -> Kafka: publish bank_b.credit_accepted
deactivate BankB

== Step 7: Payment Orch Routes to Settlement ==
Kafka -> Payment: listen bank_b.credit_accepted

activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: update status = SETTLEMENT_TRIGGERED\nenregistrer OutboxEvent\n(payment.settlement_triggered)
Payment -> Kafka: publish payment.settlement_triggered
deactivate Payment

== Step 8: Settlement Records Ledger ==
Kafka -> Settlement: listen payment.settlement_triggered

activate Settlement
Settlement -> Settlement: créer 2 LedgerEntry (IMMUTABLE)\nDEBIT Bank A\nCREDIT Bank B\nvérifier: SUM(DEBIT) = SUM(CREDIT)
Settlement -> Settlement: enregistrer OutboxEvent\n(clearing.settlement_confirmed)
Settlement -> Kafka: publish clearing.settlement_confirmed
deactivate Settlement

== Step 9: Payment Finalized ==
Kafka -> Payment: listen clearing.settlement_confirmed

activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: update status = SETTLED\nenregistrer OutboxEvent\n(payment.settled)
Payment -> Kafka: publish payment.settled
deactivate Payment

== ✅ Virement Complété ==
note over Client, Settlement
  ✅ FINAL STATE:
  
  • Payment Status: SETTLED (irrévocable)
  • Alice Balance: -100 CAD (immutable at Bank A)
  • Bob Balance: +100 CAD (immutable at Bank B)
  • BC Ledger: DEBIT = CREDIT (append-only, signed)
  
  ⏱️ Duration: ~1500-2500ms
  📊 Events Logged: 9 (in Kafka, 7-day retention)
  
  🔒 Guarantees:
  ✓ Exactly-once (idempotency cache + outbox)
  ✓ Atomic transactions (no half-states)
  ✓ Zero data loss (outbox polling)
  ✓ Settlement finality (ledger immutable)
end note

@enduml
